{"id":"wb-8-426","name":"泸县圆通寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"泸县圆通寺","text":"圆通寺，又称圆通禅林、元通寺，位于四川省泸州市泸县喻寺镇雷坝村，始建于明正德元年（1506年）。2002年12月27日公布为四川省第六批省级文物保护单位。2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%B8%E5%8E%BF%E5%9C%86%E9%80%9A%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93089350,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93089350","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5d8ec0ccdc8861a5f69a1978.jpg","title":"泸县圆通寺.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B3%B8%E5%8E%BF%E5%9C%86%E9%80%9A%E5%AF%BA.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/%E6%B3%B8%E5%8E%BF%E5%9C%86%E9%80%9A%E5%AF%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Yuantong Temple of Luxian County","width":320,"height":215,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}